kdna-react provides React components and hooks for building
KDNA-integrated web applications. Components handle explicit file selection,
public Read requests, lifecycle state and bounded result presentation.

This package reuses @aikdna/kdna-web-client for Core-admitted selection,
remote Read transport, safe errors and public result views. The embedding
supplies the explicit transport context and trusted Host boundary. Presentation
does not grant identity, disclosure or action authority.

